  "_comment3": "APM Server maps standard OTel HTTP attributes to native APM fields (http.request.method etc.).",
  "_comment4": "Custom ES attributes (es.node.name etc.) are stored as clean labels.* without the otel_attributes_ prefix.",
  "_comment5": "Source: AbstractTracesIT.assertNodeStatsRootSpanAttributes() in elastic/elasticsearch#146096",
